{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48492","headline":"道者遗记 · 不详","name":"道者遗记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武之在卯，尧王八季。\n我弃其寝，我去其扆。\n深深然，高高然。\n人不吾知，又不吾谓。\n由今之後，二百余祀。\n焰焰其光，和和其始。\n东方有兔，小首元尾。\n经过吾道，来至吾里。\n饮吾泉以醉，登吾榻而寐。\n刻乎其壁，奥乎其义。\n人谁以辨，其东平子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}